      "mechanism": "Qualifies output_rst_sync3 with input_rst_sync3, aligning the two clock domain resets. The failure at cycle 8 on output_axis_tdata with zero state_edges suggests cross-domain reset misalignment; this gate couples the resets directly at the pointer reset site."
