      "source_line": 110,
      "mechanism": "Qualifies the input clock async_rst with input_rst_sync3, ensuring the input domain reset only completes after the three-stage synchronizer finishes. Dependency cites failure_cycle 8 on output_axis_tdata, linking input reset completion to the downstream output data mismatch."
