      "source_line": 105,
      "mechanism": "Qualifies input_axis_tready with !output_rst_sync2, preventing ready assertion until the output domain reset has propagated to stage 2. The cycle 4 input_axis_tready mismatch (actual 1, expected 0) aligns with premature ready during output reset synchronizer traversal."
    },
    {
      "id": "patch_6976d9270b79",
