      "source_line": 160,
      "mechanism": "Qualifies output_rst_sync3 with !input_rst_sync3, ensuring output pointer reset only runs when input reset has fully cleared. Zero state_edges at failure_cycle 8 on output_axis_tdata indicates a cross-domain reset sequencing hazard this gate addresses."
